name: sim.getEulerAnglesFromMatrix
description: Retrieves the Euler angles from a transformation matrix
luaSynopsis: list eulerAngles = sim.getEulerAnglesFromMatrix(list matrix)
pythonSynopsis: float[3] eulerAngles = sim.getEulerAnglesFromMatrix(float[12] matrix)
inputs:
1. matrix: array of 12 values [Vx0 Vy0 Vz0 P0 Vx1 Vy1 Vz1 P1 Vx2 Vy2 Vz2 P2]
outputs:
1. eulerAngles: array of 3 values
replacedBy:
- use simEigen methods
